<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41262" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτά̆φ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάφος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>over</i> or <i>at a tomb,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγὼν ἐ.</span>
			<i>funeral</i> games, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				58.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				17.117
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτάφιον</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγῶνα</span>) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγωνίσασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					5(1).660
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pyrrh.</u>
				31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Eun.</u>
				4
			</span></i> ; esp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. λόγος</span>
			<i>a funeral</i> oration, such as was spoken at Athens over the
			citizens who had fallen in battle, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Mx.</u>
				236b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				20.141
			</span></i> (pl.) ; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἐ.</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1365a31
			</span></i> ; title of work by Gorgias ; applied to <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Mx.</u>
			</span></i> by <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				9
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἔπαινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.218a
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. σοφιστής,</span> of one
				<i>who makes such speeches,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ach.Tat.
				3.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτάφια, τά,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτάφιος ἀγών</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1006.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				12(5).946.16
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Tenos</span>).</div>
